        "description_dEqGR7": {
          "type": "description",
          "settings": {
            "description": "<p>Cavirk’s Pongal new dress collection features 129 Kanchipuram saree designs, covering premium silk, tissue silk, bridal Kanchi sarees, and affordable semi-tissue styles. This makes it one of the most complete Pongal dress collections available online.</p><p>Exquisite Kanchi Pattu Sarees – ₹20,450</p><p>Shubha Muhurtham – Red Kanchipuram Silk Saree with Gold Zari Border, Kanchi Rajahamsa, Swarna Kanchipuram, Heritage Kanchivaram, Traditional Treasure, Dravidian Drape, The Empress Drape, The Golden Signature, Kanchi’s Finest, Kanchi Brilliance</p><p>Ideal <strong>traditional Pongal sarees</strong> with rich silk and classic zari work.</p><p><strong>Premium Kanchi Pattu Tissue Sarees – ₹28,400</strong></p><p>Swarna Jyothi, Kanchi Swarna Mahal, Kanchi Radiance, Eternal Glow,  Kanchi Kalaa Gold, Handloom Zari King, The Golden Fidelity, Kanchi Shimmer, The Golden Mirage, Misty Moonlight, Mint Mirage Silk, Petal Pink Kanchi, Pale Gold Delight, Ethereal Pastel, Sheer Gold Elegance, Kanchi Tissue Lite, Airy Zari Drape, Golden Mist Tissue, Pure Zari Pastel,<br/> Handcrafted Legacy, Masterpiece Zari, Kanchi Heritage Gold, Swarna Shuddha, The Elegant Drape, Sundari Swarna, Diva Pattu Tissue, Royal Bloom Saree, Golden Twilight,  Prosperity Drape</p><p>These are premium <strong>Pongal trending dress</strong> options for festive elegance.</p><p><strong>Pure Handloom Kanchi Pattu Tissue Sarees – ₹10,800</strong></p><p>Kanchi Jewel Tones, Kanchi Rhythm, Mangala Kanchi, Kanchi Sparkle, Urban Kanchi, Kanchi Charm, Kanchi Comfort, Runway Kanchi, Aura of Kanchi, Modern Madras Drape, Fusion Kanchi, Chic Pattu Saree,  New Age Kanchipuram, Designer Kanchi, Cloud Nine Kanchi, Breezy Kanchipuram, Nimble Drape, Kanchi Lite, Kanchi Melody</p><p>Perfect <strong>dress for Pongal</strong> with comfort and traditional charm.</p><p><strong>Kanchi Bridal & Festive Sarees – ₹22,700</strong></p><p>Maharani Muhurtham, Bridal Gold Kanchi, Sacred Vows, Kanchi Thirumana, Kanaka Silk, Honeymoon Heritage, Gold Radiance Kanchi, Light of Kanchi, The Lustrous Drape, Brocade Kanchipuram, Exquisite Kanchi, The Kanchi Canvas</p><p>Statement <strong>Pongal dress for women</strong> suitable for grand celebrations.</p><p><strong>Semi-Tissue Kanchi Sarees – Pongal Offer Dress – ₹7,400</strong></p><p>Soft Gold Kanchi, Aura Tissue Drape, Kanchi Gloss Pattu,  Ethereal Touch Kanchi, Kanchi Luminosity, Glazed Kanchipuram, Kanchi Fabric Art, Smooth Drape Silk, Grand Occasion Drape, Kanchi Fiber Gloss, Shubh Mangal Saree, Pre-Wedding Pattu,  Bridal Dream Lite, Pooja Perfection, Wedding Guest Glam,  Pattu Party Wear, The Royal Look Lite, Bridal Beauty Lite,  Gold for Glamour, The Ceremonial Drape, Machine Magic Kanchi, Loom Line Kanchi, Bridal Budget Bliss, Kanchi Art Weave ,  Kanchi Machine Style, Kanchi Soft Weave, Kanchi Charm Blend, Kanchi Pattern Play, Silk Style Vision, Kanchi Weaver Look,<br/> Value for Design, Kanchi Style Value, Kanchi Express, Durable Drape, Affordable Kanchi, Kanchi Automation Silk, Regal Look Lite, Kanchi Smooth Flow, Value Kanchipuram,<br/> Kanchi Tradition Lite, Tissue Flow Kanchi, Kanchi Pattern Plus, Kanchi Value Blend, The Rich Look Pattu, Contemporary Kanchi, Kanchi ChicMite, Eternal Glam Lite, Kanchi Style Flow, Zari Queen, Vivid Kanchi Light, Zari Effect Pattu, Handfeel Kanchi, Kanchi Rayon Gold, Kanchi Mirror Design, Kanchi Temple Weave, Aarti Gold Drape</p><p>These are affordable <strong>Pongal offer dress</strong> options rooted in tradition.<br/><br/></p>",
